# Oversized generated device artifacts — too big for git (GitHub rejects >100MB).
# Regenerate: .xtc/.xtcz via the official Xteink app from the X4 PDFs; the image
# EPUB via its build step. Keep the source PDFs/EPUBs (small) committed instead.
dist/**/*.xtc
dist/**/*.xtcz
